<section class="typology-section">
  <div class="typology-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-lang-en="Typology" data-lang-zh="类型学">类型学</p>
    <h2
      id="typology-title"
      data-lang-en="Typology of Post-Disaster Recovery Trajectories"
      data-lang-zh="灾后恢复轨迹类型学"
    >
      灾后恢复轨迹类型学
    </h2>
    <p
      class="typology-description"
      data-lang-en="Recovery outcomes as a function of material reconstruction and relational reassembly across four dimensions of re-inhabitability."
      data-lang-zh="恢复结果取决于物质重建程度与可再栖居四个维度中的关系重组。"
    >
      恢复结果取决于物质重建程度与可再栖居四个维度中的关系重组。
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="typology-panel" aria-labelledby="typology-title">
    <div class="typology-body">
      <aside class="typology-legend" aria-label="Relational dimensions">
        <div>
          <strong data-lang-en="Degree of Relational Reassembly" data-lang-zh="关系重组程度">
            关系重组程度
          </strong>
          <span
            data-lang-en="across four dimensions of re-inhabitability"
            data-lang-zh="跨越可再栖居的四个维度"
          >
            跨越可再栖居的四个维度
          </span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li class="legend-social">
            <i></i>
            <span data-lang-en="Social relations" data-lang-zh="社会关系">社会关系</span>
          </li>
          <li class="legend-ecological">
            <i></i>
            <span data-lang-en="Ecological processes" data-lang-zh="生态过程">生态过程</span>
          </li>
          <li class="legend-multispecies">
            <i></i>
            <span data-lang-en="Multispecies co-existence" data-lang-zh="多物种共存">多物种共存</span>
          </li>
          <li class="legend-cultural">
            <i></i>
            <span data-lang-en="Cultural-symbolic continuity" data-lang-zh="文化-象征连续性">
              文化-象征连续性
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>

      <div class="typology-map">
        <span class="axis-high y-high" data-lang-en="High" data-lang-zh="高">高</span>
        <span class="axis-low y-low" data-lang-en="Low" data-lang-zh="低">低</span>
        <span class="axis-low x-low" data-lang-en="Low" data-lang-zh="低">低</span>
        <span class="axis-high x-high" data-lang-en="High" data-lang-zh="高">高</span>
        <span
          class="x-axis-title"
          data-lang-en="Degree of Material Reconstruction"
          data-lang-zh="物质重建程度"
        >
          物质重建程度
        </span>

        <div class="typology-grid">
          <article class="typology-card relational">
            <span class="typology-icon" aria-hidden="true">RI</span>
            <h4 data-lang-en="Relational Persistence" data-lang-zh="关系性延续">关系性延续</h4>
            <p class="typology-sub" data-lang-en="Low material / High relational" data-lang-zh="低物质 / 高关系">
              低物质 / 高关系
            </p>
            <p
              data-lang-en="Relational continuity is sustained through social ties, ecological practices, multispecies relations, and cultural meanings."
              data-lang-zh="关系连续性通过社会联系、生态实践、多物种关系和文化意义得以维持。"
            >
              关系连续性通过社会联系、生态实践、多物种关系和文化意义得以维持。
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="typology-card integrated">
            <span class="typology-icon" aria-hidden="true">IN</span>
            <h4 data-lang-en="Integrated Re-inhabitation" data-lang-zh="整合型再栖居">整合型再栖居</h4>
            <p class="typology-sub" data-lang-en="High material / High relational" data-lang-zh="高物质 / 高关系">
              高物质 / 高关系
            </p>
            <p
              data-lang-en="Material reconstruction progresses with the reassembly of social, ecological, multispecies, and cultural-symbolic relations."
              data-lang-zh="物质重建与社会、生态、多物种和文化-象征关系的重组同步推进。"
            >
              物质重建与社会、生态、多物种和文化-象征关系的重组同步推进。
            </p>
          </article>

          <div class="typology-center">
            <strong data-lang-en="Uneven Relational Reassembly" data-lang-zh="不均衡的关系重组">
              不均衡的关系重组
            </strong>

          </div>

          <article class="typology-card collapsed">
            <span class="typology-icon" aria-hidden="true">CR</span>
            <h4 data-lang-en="Collapsed Recovery" data-lang-zh="崩塌型恢复">崩塌型恢复</h4>
            <p class="typology-sub" data-lang-en="Low material / Low relational" data-lang-zh="低物质 / 低关系">
              低物质 / 低关系
            </p>
            <p
              data-lang-en="Material reconstruction and relational reassembly both fail to progress, reinforcing uninhabitable conditions."
              data-lang-zh="物质重建和关系重组都未能推进，并共同强化不可居条件。"
            >
              物质重建和关系重组都未能推进，并共同强化不可居条件。
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="typology-card disembedded">
            <span class="typology-icon" aria-hidden="true">DR</span>
            <h4 data-lang-en="Disembedded Reconstruction" data-lang-zh="脱嵌式重建">脱嵌式重建</h4>
            <p class="typology-sub" data-lang-en="High material / Low relational" data-lang-zh="高物质 / 低关系">
              高物质 / 低关系
            </p>
            <p
              data-lang-en="Physical reconstruction is achieved, but relational systems remain weak, fragmented, or excluded."
              data-lang-zh="物理重建已经完成，但关系系统仍然薄弱、碎片化或被排除。"
            >
              物理重建已经完成，但关系系统仍然薄弱、碎片化或被排除。
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
